Revision history for Alien-libhisto

0.4.0   2026-09-08
        - Synchronize bundled libhisto C library to v0.4.0.
        - Bundle new C++17 modern headers (include/histo/*.hpp).
        - Purge editor swap files and update MANIFEST.SKIP patterns.

0.3.0   2026-08-29
        - Synchronize bundled libhisto C library to v0.3.0.
        - Fix Windows MSVC / Strawberry Perl build failure with cross-platform console and header shims.
        - Fix AArch64 / ARM compilation by automatically disabling unsupported -mavx2/-mfma flags via CMake CheckCCompilerFlag.
        - Fix FreeBSD Clang compilation error under -Werror.
        - Support building with CMake NMake generator on Visual Studio.

0.2.0   2026-08-21
        - Synchronize bundled libhisto C library to v0.2.0.
        - Automatic cleaning of stale build caches on in-tree builds.

0.1.0   2026-08-20
        - Initial CPAN release of Alien::libhisto packaging libhisto C library.

